WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.960
Yo, wassup, dawg?

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:16.440
This week we keepin it together with "Things Fall Apart" by Chinua Achebe.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:21.420
Okonkwo got one of da illest reps
of any hood in the Nigerian Umuofia clan.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.660
But bein a high baller don’t run in the family.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.940
Errybody know dat Okonkwo’s daddy was nothin but a broke-ass scrub,

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.880
and now Okonkwo gotta be a hard-ass hustla to shake off dat family shame.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:38.340
When some fool mercs a dame from Umuofia, Okonkwo gotta take care of his boy, Ikemefuna,

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.820
to make everything cool between the clans.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:44.520
Okonkwo got mad love for this kid, even though he don’t show it.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:49.020
And it ain’t long before Ikemefuna starts callin Okonkwo "Daddy."

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:53.240
Then one day, the Oracle say dat fool Ikemefuna
gotta get put in dirt.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:58.120
Some geezer named Ezeudu tells Okonkwo
he best stay away from dat mess.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:03.620
Cuz no matter how much of a bad-ass thug you are, killin yo own son is wack.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:08.780
But Okonkwo don’t wanna be seen as no sensitive b*tch, so he straps up ready to bang out.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:14.060
When Ikemefuna cries, “Little help,
Pops?” Okonkwo ends dat fool.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:17.740
And for the next few days, Okonkwo all torn up.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.920
Sh*t gets even more cray for
Okonkwo during his boy Ezeudu’s funeral.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:27.280
During the salute, Okonkwo’s gat accidentally
busts a cap in Ezeudu’s son!

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.860
So Okonkwo and his family get booted outta town for 7 years!

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:32.880
While he gone,

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:38.320
a bunch of bible-thumpin crackers roll up to
Umuofia, tryna convert homies all ova town.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:41.540
Soon, they got a whole new government up in
dis piece!

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:42.320
Damn!

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:47.540
When Okonkwo gets back home, he all
like, “Man, who are these honkies?!”

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:52.680
So, he and his tribal leader homies roll up
to a church and stomp dat sh*t to the ground.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.460
“This is our turf, suckas!”

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.640
After gettin thrown in the slammer for a bit,

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:01.720
Okonkwo rallies errybody to wage war against them imperialist fools.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:05.940
When one of dem oppressors steps to, Okonkwo takes that fool out.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:11.020
But when he tries to get his posse to revolt against these haters, like all good Umuofians do,

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.260
they all back down like a buncha ol' b*tches.

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:19.180
Later, the top dog white man rolls
up to Okonkwo’s crib to take him downtown.

00:02:19.189 --> 00:02:22.620
But when he walk in, Okonkwo hangin by a noose.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:26.420
Fool took himself out for good. Damn.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:36.080
First thing you best recognize is that lil Achebe came up in Nigeria after it was taken over by da west.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:40.920
Even though this book definitely got beef with the empire that did Igbo culture straight dirty,

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:43.320
good art don’t just give
one perspective.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:47.800
See, Okonkwo reppin all the social
values of the ol' Igbo society.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:53.980
He clockin mad courage, goes hard for da hood, and don’t let no candy-ass emotions get in his way.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:59.000
And for bein the realest brotha on the streets,
the elders trust him to raise Ikemefuna.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.120
But it ain’t all gravy for Okonkwo.

00:03:01.129 --> 00:03:03.360
When time comes to kill Ikemefuna,

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:08.160
Okonkwo knows bein the one to shank his boy gonna piss off the Goddess real bad.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:12.360
But he ain’t no lazy coward like his daddy, and fool desperate to prove it.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:18.660
After Ikemefuna dead, it’s just one tragedy after another, til Okonkwo offs himself.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:22.480
Even his main man, Obierika, tell him dat was a messed up thing to do.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:26.580
"If I were you I would have stayed at home. What you have done will not please the Earth.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:30.700
It is the kind of action for which the goddess wipes out whole families."

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:34.860
Ain’t no doubt that those crooked-ass imperialists took a big ol' dump on Africa.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:39.580
But like we can see with Okonkwo icin his
boy and disrespecting the goddess,

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.620
maybe things started fallin apart before they got there.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:48.440
Just like Yeats preachin in the poem that opens the book, whether it be Igbo culture, western culture,

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:51.560
or whateverthef**k — time is the enemy.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.960
And as time goes on, any culture can fall apart.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:59.500
But you know what don’t fall apart?
These sick-ass threads you can get from my store.

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:06.320
See y’all next week, playboy!

